# Round 18, C1-47 (fixed). L §5.16 The closed list: "mean(d) of a distribution value is refused (LOAD-RANDOM, A-42),
# and the table's mean is the one a closed form and random at mean read"; in a def (here) as in an ask
# (L5_16_mean_of_dist_value_ask). The table's means are read of random facts in L5_16_mean_table_random_facts.
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
input a2: num
input b4: num
def um: num = mean(uniform(a2, b4))

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  a2 = 2
  b4 = 4

ask q2: um
=== expect
refused: LOAD-RANDOM ...
